<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMOS</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc3">Am</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMOS</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="AMO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 1:1"/>Pawòl a Amos, ki te pami bèje mouton <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:2">II Sam 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:5">Za 14:5</ref> </char></note>Tekoa yo, de sa li te wè nan vizyon konsènan Israël nan jou a Ozias, wa Juda a, e nan jou a Jéroboam, fis a Joas la, wa Israël la, dezan avan tranbleman tè an. <verse eid="AMO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 1:2"/>Li te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:13">És 42:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“SENYÈ a va gwonde soti nan Sion.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">Li va fè son vwa Li soti Jérusalem;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">epi patiraj a bèje yo va fè dèy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:2">e anwo tèt Carmel va vin seche nèt.”<verse eid="AMO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 1:3"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:3">“Akoz de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:1">Am 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 2:4">4</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 2:6">6</ref></char></note>twa transgresyon a Damas yo, menm kat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:3">mwen p ap retire pinisyon li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:3">akoz yo te bat Galaad ak zouti an fè yo.<verse eid="AMO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 1:4"/>Pou sa, Mwen va voye dife sou kay Hazaël</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:4">e li va devore sitadèl a Ben-Hadad yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:1">I Wa 20:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 1:5"/>Anplis, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:30">Jr 51:30</ref> </char></note>kase baryè an fè Damas la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:5">Mwen va koupe retire sila ki rete nan vale Bikath-Aven nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:5">ak sila ki kenbe baton wayal la soti Beth-Éden;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:5">epi pèp Syrie a va ale an egzil an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:9">II Wa 16:9</ref></char></note>Kir,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 1:5">di SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 1:6"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:6">“Akoz de twa transgresyon Gaza yo, menm kat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:6">mwen p ap retire pinisyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:6">akoz yo te depòte tout pèp la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:6">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 35:5">Éz 35:5</ref> </char></note>livre yo bay Édom.<verse eid="AMO 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 1:7"/>Pou sa, Mwen va voye dife sou miray Gaza a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:7">epi li va devore sitadèl li yo nèt.<verse eid="AMO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 1:8"/>Anplis, Mwen va koupe retire sila ki rete Asdod yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:8">ak sila ki kenbe baton wayal la nan Askalon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:8">Mwen va tounen men mwen kont Ékron,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:8">epi retay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">És 14:29-31</ref></char></note>Filisten yo va peri,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 1:8">di Senyè BONDYE a.<verse eid="AMO 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 1:9"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:9">“Akoz de twa transgresyon Tyr yo, menm kat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:9">mwen p ap retire pinisyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:9">akoz yo te livre tout pèp la nèt bay Édom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:9">e yo pa t sonje akò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:11-14">I Wa 9:11-14</ref> </char></note>fratènèl la.<verse eid="AMO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 1:10"/>Akoz sa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:5">Za 14:5</ref></char></note>voye dife sou miray Tyr la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:10">e li va devore sitadèl li yo.”<verse eid="AMO 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 1:11"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">“Akoz de twa transgresyon Édom yo, menm kat;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">Mwen p ap retire pinisyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">akoz li te kouri dèyè frè l ak nepe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">e te refize gen pitye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">Mekontantman li te dechire tout tan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:11">e li te kenbe kòlè li jis pou tout tan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:14-21">Nonb 20:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:16">És 57:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 1:12"/>Pou sa, Mwen va voye dife sou Théman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:12">e li va devore tout sitadèl Botsra yo.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:7">Jr 49:7</ref>,<ref loc="JER 49:20">20</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 1:13"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:13">“Akoz de twa transgresyon a fis a Ammon yo, menm kat;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:13">Mwen p ap retire pinisyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:13">akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:16">II Wa 15:16</ref></char></note>chire vant fanm ansent Galaad yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:13">pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:8">És 5:8</ref> </char></note>agrandi lizyè yo.<verse eid="AMO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 1:14"/>Pou sa, Mwen va sanble yon dife sou miray <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:11">Det 3:11</ref></char></note>Rabba a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:14">Li va devore sitadèl li yo nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:14">nan mitan gwo kri lagè nan jou batay la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 1:14">nan mitan siklòn nan jou tanpèt la.<verse eid="AMO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 1:15"/>Konsa, wa yo a va antre an egzil, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:3">Jr 49:3</ref></char></note> li menm ansanm ak prens li yo,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 1:15">di Senyè a.<verse eid="AMO 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="AMO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 2:1"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:1">“Akoz de twa transgresyon Moab yo, menm kat;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:1">Mwen p ap retire pinisyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:1">akoz li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:26">II Wa 3:26</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 3:27">27</ref></char></note>brile zo a wa Édom nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:1">pou l fè lacho.<verse eid="AMO 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 2:2"/>Pou sa, Mwen va voye dife sou Moab</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:2">e li va devore sitadèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:24">Jr 48:24</ref>,<ref loc="JER 48:41">41</ref></char></note>Kérijoth yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:2">Moab va mouri nan mitan gwo zen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:2">kri lagè ak son a twonpèt.<verse eid="AMO 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 2:3"/>Anplis, Mwen va koupe retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:10">Sòm 2:10</ref></char></note>jij la nan mitan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:3">e touye tout prens li yo ansanm avè l,” di SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 2:4"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">“Akoz de twa transgresyon a Juda yo, menm kat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">mwen p ap retire pinisyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:17-20">Jij 2:17-20</ref> </char></note>rejte lalwa SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">e yo pa t kenbe règleman Li yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:15">És 9:15</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 9:16">16</ref></char>
    </note>manti yo te koz yo vin egare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:4">dèyè sila menm papa zansèt yo te mache.<verse eid="AMO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 2:5"/>Pou sa, Mwen va voye dife sou Juda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:5">e li va devore palè a Jérusalem yo.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:27">Jr 17:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 2:6"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:6">“Akoz de twa transgresyon a Israël yo, menm kat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:6">Mwen p ap retire pinisyon an;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:6">akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:3">Jl 3:3</ref></char></note>vann sila ki dwat yo pou lajan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:6">e malere yo pou achte de grenn sapat.<verse eid="AMO 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 2:7"/>Sila yo k ap foule tèt a malere a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:7">jis pou l rive nan pousyè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:7">k ap refi bay jistis a oprimen an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:7">Yon gason ak papa li antre nan menm fanm nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:7">pou yo ka pwofane non sen Mwen an.<verse eid="AMO 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 2:8"/>Yo lonje kò yo bò kote tout lotèl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:8">sou vètman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:26">Egz 22:26</ref></char></note>ki te pran kon garanti yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:8">Nan kay Bondye yo a, yo bwè diven nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:8">ki te bay pou peye amann yo.<verse eid="AMO 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 2:9"/>Malgre sa, se te Mwen menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:9">ki te detwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:23-25">Nonb 21:23-25</ref> </char></note>Amoreyen yo devan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:9">malgre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:32">Nonb 13:32</ref></char></note>wotè yo te tankou wotè a pye palmis</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:9">e yo te gen fòs tankou bwadchenn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:9">Mwen te detwi ni fwi yo pa anlè, ni rasin yo pa anba.<verse eid="AMO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 2:10"/>“Se te Mwen menm ki te mennen nou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:10">monte soti peyi Égypte la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:10">E Mwen te mennen nou nan dezè a pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:7">Det 2:7</ref></char></note>karantan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:10">pou nou ta ka posede peyi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:8">Egz 3:8</ref> </char></note>Amoreyen yo.<verse eid="AMO 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 2:11"/>Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:18">Det 18:18</ref> </char></note>fè leve kèk nan fis nou yo kon pwofèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:11">e kèk nan jennonm nou yo kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:2">Nonb 6:2</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 6:3">3</ref></char></note>Nazareyen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:11">Èske se pa sa, fis Israël yo?” di SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 2:12"/>Men, nou te fè Nazareyen yo bwè divin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:12">e nou te kòmande pwofèt yo. Nou te di yo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:12">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:10">És 30:10</ref> </char>
    </note>“Pa pwofetize!”<verse eid="AMO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 2:13"/>Gade byen, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:14">És 1:14</ref></char></note>va peze nou anba chaj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:13">kon kabwa chaje lè l plen chaj sereyal.<verse eid="AMO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 2:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 30:16">És 30:16</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 30:17">17</ref></char>
    </note>Kouri kite p ap posib, menm pou sila ki pi vit la;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:14">Sila ki dyanm lan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:14">p ap ka ranfòse fòs li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:14">ni sila ki pwisan an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:14">p ap ka delivre tèt li.<verse eid="AMO 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 2:15"/>Ni sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:56">Jr 51:56</ref> </char></note>fò ak banza a, p ap ka kanpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:15">Sila ki rapid a pye a p ap ka delivre tèt li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:15">Sila ki konn monte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:3">És 31:3</ref></char></note>cheval la p ap chape.<verse eid="AMO 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 2:16"/>Menm pi brav pami gèrye yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 2:16">va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:17">Jij 4:17</ref></char></note>chape poul yo toutouni nan jou sa a”,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 2:16">di SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="AMO 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 3:1"/>Tande pawòl sa a ke SENYÈ a te pale kont nou menm, fis Israël yo; kont tout fanmi ke Li te mennen fè monte soti nan peyi Égypte la:<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:3">Jr 8:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 3:2"/>“Nou sèlman, Mwen te chwazi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:2">pami tout fanmi sou latè yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:2">Akoz sa, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:10">Jr 14:10</ref></char></note>pini nou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:2">pou tout inikite nou yo.”<verse eid="AMO 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 3:3"/>Èske de mache ansanm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:3">san yo pa antann yo?<verse eid="AMO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 3:4"/>Èske yon lyon va gwonde nan rak bwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:4">san ke li pa kaptire yon bagay?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:4">Èske yon jèn ti lyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:4">ka kriye deyò tanyè a san li pa pran anyen?<verse eid="AMO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 3:5"/>Èske yon zwazo ka kenbe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:5">nan yon pèlen atè, si resò a pa t rale?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:5">Èske pèlen an ka vòltije sòti atè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:5">san ke li gen yon bagay pou kenbe?<verse eid="AMO 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 3:6"/>Èske twonpèt sone nan vil la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:6">san pèp la p ap pè?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:6">Èske malè kon rive nan yon vil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:6">san ke SENYÈ a ki fè l?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">És 14:24-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 3:7"/>Anverite, SENYÈ a p ap fè anyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:7">san Li pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:13">Jen 6:13</ref></char></note>aveti sèvitè li yo, pwofèt yo.<verse eid="AMO 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 3:8"/>Yon lyon fin gwonde!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:8">Se kilès ki p ap pè?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:8">SENYÈ a fin pale!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:8">Se kilès ki ka refize pwofetize?<verse eid="AMO 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 3:9"/>Pwoklame sou sitadèl Asdod yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:9">ak sitadèl peyi Égypte yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:9">Di yo konsa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:9">Rasanble nou sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:1">Am 4:1</ref></char></note>mòn Samarie yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:9">pou wè gwo zen ki anndan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:9">ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:11">Am 5:11</ref> </char></note>opresyon ki nan mitan yo.<verse eid="AMO 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 3:10"/>“Paske yo pa konn fè sa ki dwat,” di SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:10">“sila yo k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:8-10">Hab 2:8-10</ref></char></note>kache piyaj yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:10">ak sa yo ranmase nan palè pa yo.”<verse eid="AMO 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 3:11"/>Pou sa, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:11">“Yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 6:14">Am 6:14</ref></char></note>lènmi va ranvwaye peyi a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:11">Li va rale desann barikad ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:11">epi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:5">Am 2:5</ref> </char></note>sitadèl ou yo va piyaje.”<verse eid="AMO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 3:12"/>Konsa pale SENYÈ a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:12">Menm jan bèje a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:34-37">I Sam 17:34-37</ref></char></note>rache de janm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:12">soti nan bouch lyon an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:12">oswa yon mòso zòrèy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:12">konsa, fis Israël ki rete Samarie yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:12">alèz sou bèl mèb yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:12">ak kousen swa yo sou kabann nan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:12">va vin chape.<verse eid="AMO 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 3:13"/>“Tande, e fè temwaye kont kay Jacob la,” di Senyè BONDYE a, Bondye dèzame yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:7">Éz 2:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 3:14"/>“Paske nan jou ke Mwen va vizite</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:14">transgresyon Israël yo sou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:14">Mwen va anplis, vizite lotèl Béthel yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:14">Konsa, kòn lotèl yo va vin koupe retire nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:14">Yo va tonbe atè.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:15">II Wa 23:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 3:15"/>Kay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 36:22">Jr 36:22</ref> </char></note> sezon livè a, Mwen va frape</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:15">ansanm avèk kay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:20">Jij 3:20</ref></char></note> sezon lete a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:15">Kay livwa yo va vin peri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 3:15">e gran mezon yo p ap la ankò,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 3:15">di Senyè a.<verse eid="AMO 3:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="AMO 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 4:1"/>Tande pawòl sa a, nou menm, vach <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:12">Sòm 22:12</ref> </char></note>Basan k ap rete sou mòn Samarie yo, k ap oprime malere, k ap kraze sila ki nan bezwen yo, ki di a mari nou yo: “Pote bwason nou!”<verse eid="AMO 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 4:2"/>Senyè BONDYE a te sèmante pa sentete Li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:2">“Gade byen, jou yo ap vini sou nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:2">lè yo va rache pran nou ak kwòk vyann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:2">e dènye bout nan nou ak gaf pwason.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:29">És 37:29</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:16">Jr 16:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 4:3"/>Nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:7">Jr 52:7</ref></char></note>sòti atravè brèch miray yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:3">nou chak tou dwat devan li a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:3">e konsa, nou va jete nan sitadèl la,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 4:4"/>“Antre nan Béthel pou fè peche;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:4">nan Guilgal pou miltipliye peche yo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:4">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 28:3">Nonb 28:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pote sakrifis nou yo chak maten,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:4">dim nou yo chak twa jou.<verse eid="AMO 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 4:5"/>Ofri yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:13">Lev 7:13</ref> </char></note>ofrann remèsiman,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:5">sitou sa ki gen ledven ladan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:5">epi pwoklame <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:18-21">Lev 22:18-21</ref></char></note>ofrann bòn volonte yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:5">Fè l parèt wo pou moun wè!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:5">Paske se konsa nou renmen fè l, nou menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:5">fis Israël yo,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 4:6"/>“Men Mwen te bay nou anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 3:1">És 3:1</ref></char></note>dan netwaye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:6">nan tout vil nou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:6">ak mank pen tout kote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:6">Malgre sa, nou pa t retounen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:6">vin jwenn Mwen,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 4:7"/>Anplis de sa, Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:17">Det 11:17</ref></char></note>fè lapli sispann</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:7">pandan te gen twa mwa ankò avan rekòlt la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:7">Konsa, Mwen te voye lapli nan yon vil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:7">pandan Mwen te refize li nan yon lòt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:7">Yon pati te jwenn lapli, pandan pati ki pa t</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:7">resevwa lapli a te seche.<verse eid="AMO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 4:8"/>Konsa, de oswa twa vil te kilbite rive nan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:8">yon lòt pou bwè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:5">I Wa 18:5</ref> </char></note>dlo, men yo pa t satisfè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:8">malgre sa, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:7">Jr 3:7</ref></char></note>pa t retounen vin jwenn Mwen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:8">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 4:9"/>Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:22">Det 28:22</ref> </char></note>frape nou ak van cho, ak lakanni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:9">epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:4">Jl 1:4</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 1:7">7</ref></char></note>cheni te devore jaden ak chan</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:9">rezen nou yo, pye figye etranje ak pye doliv yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:9">Malgre sa, nou pa t retounen vin jwenn Mwen,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:9">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 4:10"/>“Mwen te voye yon epidemi nan mitan nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">tankou sa ki te konn rive an Égypte yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:22">Jr 11:22</ref> </char></note>touye jenn mesye nou yo ak nepe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">e te retire cheval nou yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">E Mwen te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:20">Jl 2:20</ref></char></note>movèz odè kan ou</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">monte antre nan nen nou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">Malgre sa, nou pa t retounen vin jwenn Mwen,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:10">deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 4:11"/>“Mwen te boulvèse kèk nan nou nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:11">jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Jen 19:24</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 19:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:2">So 3:2</ref></char></note>Bondye te boulvèse Sodome ak Gomorrhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:11">Nou te tankou yon bout bwa byen cho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:11">ki te rache soti nan dife;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:11">malgre sa, nou pa t retounen vin jwenn Mwen,” deklare SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 4:12"/>“Akoz sa, se konsa Mwen va fè ou, O Israël!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:12">Paske se sa Mwen va fè ou;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:12">prepare pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:11">És 32:11</ref> </char></note>rankontre Bondye ou a, O Israël.<verse eid="AMO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 4:13"/>Paske gade byen, Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 38:4-7">Job 38:4-7</ref> </char></note>fòme mòn yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">ki kreye van an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:28">Dan 2:28</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 2:30">30</ref></char></note>deklare a lòm tout refleksyon li yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">sila ki fè jou leve nan fènwa a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">e ki foule wo plas sou latè yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 4:13">SENYÈ Bondye dèzame yo, se non Li.”<verse eid="AMO 4:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="AMO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 5:1"/>Tande pawòl sa ke m reprann pou nou kon yon chan; Yon plent konsi, pou sila ki mouri deja yo, O lakay Israël:<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:29">Jr 7:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 5:2"/>Li fin tonbe, li p ap leve ankò—</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 14:17">Jr 14:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vyèj Israël la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:2">Li kouche byen neglije sou tèren li;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 51:18">És 51:18</ref> </char>
    </note>nanpwen moun ki pou leve l.<verse eid="AMO 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 5:3"/>Paske, konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:3">“Vil ki te gen mil sòlda soti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:3">va gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:13">És 6:13</ref> </char></note>san ki rete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:3">e sila ki gen san ki ale yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:3">va gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 6:9">Am 6:9</ref></char></note>dis ki rete pou lakay Israël.”<verse eid="AMO 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 5:4"/>Paske, konsa pale SENYÈ a a lakay Israël:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:4">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:29">Det 4:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Chache Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">És 55:3</ref> </char></note>pou nou ka viv.<verse eid="AMO 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 5:5"/>Men pa ale Béthel, ni pa vini Guilgal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:5">ni travèse Beer-Schéba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:5">Paske anverite, Guilgal va antre an kaptivite</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:5">e gwo twoub va rive Béthel.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">I Wa 12:28</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 12:29">29</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 5:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">És 55:3</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 55:6">6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 55:7">7</ref> </char>
    </note>Chache SENYÈ a pou nou ka viv,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:6">sinon Li va eklate kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Det 4:24</ref></char></note>dife</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:6">nan lakay Joseph,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:6">e li va devore san pa gen okenn moun</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:6">ki pou etenn li Béthel.<verse eid="AMO 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 5:7"/>Nou menm ki fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:3">Am 2:3</ref></char></note>jistis vin tounen lanvè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:7">e ki jete ladwati rive jis atè yo,<verse eid="AMO 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 5:8"/>Chache Li ki te kreye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 9:9">Job 9:9</ref> </char></note>Pléiades ak Orion yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:22">Job 12:22</ref></char></note>chanje gwo fènwa yo pou vin tounen maten,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">ki etenn lajounen pou fè lannwit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">ki rele dlo lanmè yo e vide sou sifas tè a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:8">SENYÈ a, se non L.<verse eid="AMO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 5:9"/>Se Li menm ki jayi ak destriksyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:9">sou moun pwisan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:9">jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:11">Mi 5:11</ref> </char></note>destriksyon sa a rive sou sitadèl la.<verse eid="AMO 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 5:10"/>Yo rayi sila k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:21">És 29:21</ref></char></note>reprimande nan pòtay la</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:10">ni yo pa vle wè sila ki pale ak entegrite a.<verse eid="AMO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 5:11"/>Konsa, akoz nou foule malere a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:11">e egzije taks nan blè sou li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:11">akoz nou fin bati bèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:15">Am 3:15</ref></char></note>kay ak wòch byen taye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:11">malgre nou pa menm rete nan yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:11">konsa, nou fin plante bèl chan rezen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:11">men nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 6:15">Mi 6:15</ref> </char></note>p ap bwè diven yo.<verse eid="AMO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 5:12"/>Paske Mwen konnen transgresyon nou yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:12">vin anpil e peche nou yo vin gran;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:12">nou menm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:23">És 1:23</ref></char></note>boulvèse moun dwat yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:12">ki aksepte tout sa ki glise anba tab yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:12">e ki detounen malere a nan pòtay la.<verse eid="AMO 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 5:13"/>Alò nan yon tan konsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:13">sila ki saj la oblije rete an silans,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:13">paske tan an vin plen ak mechanste.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:7">Ekl 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 5:14"/>Chache sa ki bon e pa sa ki mal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:14">pou nou ka viv;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:14">epi konsa, SENYÈ dèzame yo kapab avèk nou,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:14">jis jan nou te pale a!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:11">Mi 3:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 5:15"/>Rayi mal e renmen sa ki bon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:15">e etabli jistis nan pòtay la!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:15">Petèt SENYÈ Bondye dèzame yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:15">ka fè gras a retay Joseph la.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 97:10">Sòm 97:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 5:16"/>Alò, SENYÈ Bondye dèzame yo, Senyè a di :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:16">“Va gen gwo lamantasyon tout kote</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:16">e nan lari a, yo va rele: ‘Elas! Elas!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:16">Yo va rele kiltivatè a pou fè dèy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:16">yo va peye moun pou l fè lamantasyon.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:10">Jr 9:10</ref>,<ref loc="JER 9:18-20">18-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 5:17"/>Epi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 16:10">És 16:10</ref></char></note> tout chan rezen yo, va gen gwo kri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:17">paske Mwen va pase nan mitan nou”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:17">di SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="AMO 5:18"/>Elas pou nou menm ki anvi wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:19">És 5:19</ref></char></note>jou SENYÈ a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:18">Pouki sa nou lanvi we jou SENYÈ a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:18">Li va yon jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:2">Jl 2:2</ref> </char></note>tenèb olye limyè.<verse eid="AMO 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="AMO 5:19"/>Tankou lè yon nonm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:24">Job 20:24</ref></char></note>kouri kite yon lyon pou l</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:19">rakontre yon lous;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:19">oswa pou l rive lakay li,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:19">apiye men l sou mi kay la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:19">pou yon koulèv vin mòde l.<verse eid="AMO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="AMO 5:20"/>Èske jou SENYÈ a p ap yon jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref> </char></note>tenèb</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:20">olye de limyè a, fènwa a menm san klate ladann?<verse eid="AMO 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="AMO 5:21"/>Mwen rayi, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:11-16">És 1:11-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:31">Lev 26:31</ref></char></note>refize aksepte fèt nou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:21">ni Mwen p ap pran plezi nan asanble solanèl nou yo.<verse eid="AMO 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="AMO 5:22"/>Menmsi nou ofri ban Mwen ofrann brile ak ofrann sereyal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:22">Mwen p ap aksepte yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:22">ni Mwen p ap menm gade <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:11-15">Lev 7:11-15</ref></char></note>ofrann lapè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:22">bèt gra nou yo.<verse eid="AMO 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="AMO 5:23"/>Retire sou Mwen bri a chanson nou yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:23">Mwen p ap menm koute son a ap nou yo.<verse eid="AMO 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="AMO 5:24"/>Men kite jistis koule desann tankou dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 5:24">e ladwati tankou yon gwo larivyè,<verse eid="AMO 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="AMO 5:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:17">Det 32:17</ref> </char>
    </note>Èske nou te pote ban Mwen ofrann sakrifis ak ofrann sereyal nan dezè a pandan karant ane yo, O lakay Israël? <verse eid="AMO 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="AMO 5:26"/>Anplis <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:43">Trav 7:43</ref> </char></note>nou te pote Sikkuth, wa nou an, ak Kiyyun, imaj nou yo, ak zetwal dye nou, ke nou te fè pou nou menm yo. <verse eid="AMO 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="AMO 5:27"/>“Pou sa, Mwen va fè nou antre an egzil pi lwen Damas,” di SENYÈ a, ki gen non Li ki se Bondye dèzame yo.<verse eid="AMO 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="AMO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 6:1"/>Malè a sila ki alèz nan Sion yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:1">e ak sila ki santi yo ansekirite nan mòn Samarie yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:1">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Egz 19:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>mesye ki distenge pami meyè nan nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:1">a sila lakay Israël konn vini yo.<verse eid="AMO 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 6:2"/>Ale janbe kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:10">Jen 10:10</ref></char></note>Calné pou gade.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:2">Soti la rive Hamath Gran an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:2">pou desann kote Gath de Filisten yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:2">Èske yo pi bon ke wayòm sila yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:2">Èske teritwa pa yo a pi gran pase pa nou an?<verse eid="AMO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 6:3"/>Malè a nou ki konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:12">És 56:12</ref></char></note>ranvoye jou malè!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:3">Ka pote sant vyolans lan vin pi pre!<verse eid="AMO 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 6:4"/>K ap repoze sou kabann fèt ak livwa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:4">k ap gaye kò yo sou gwo sofa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:4">e k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:2">Éz 34:2</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 34:3">3</ref></char></note>manje jenn mouton ki soti nan pak la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:4">ak jenn bèf ki soti nan mitan tonèl bèt la;<verse eid="AMO 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 6:5"/>sila ki enpwovize ak son ap la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:5">ki envante lenstriman mizik yo menm jan ak David;<verse eid="AMO 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 6:6"/>Sila k ap bwè diven nan kalbas sakrifis yo pandan yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:6">onksyone kò yo ak pi bon lwil yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:6">malgre sa, yo pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4">Éz 9:4</ref></char></note>kriye pou Joseph,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:6">ki fin devaste nèt la.<verse eid="AMO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 6:7"/>Akoz sa, yo va antre an egzil nan tèt a egzile yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:7">Banbòch a sanzave yo va sispann.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 7:11">Am 7:11</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 7:17">17</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 6:8"/>Senyè BONDYE a te sèmante pa Li menm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:8">SENYÈ Bondye dèzame yo te deklare:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:8">“Mwen rayi awogans a Jacob la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:8">e Mwen deteste sitadèl li yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:8">Pou sa, Mwen va livre tout vil la ak tout sa ki ladann.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 26:30">Lev 26:30</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 6:9"/>Epi li va vin rive ke si genyen dizòm ki rete</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:9">nan yon kay, yo va mouri.<verse eid="AMO 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 6:10"/>Alò tonton a youn, oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:12">I Sam 31:12</ref> </char></note>mèt mòg k ap antere l a va leve pote zo li sòti nan kay la. Konsa, li va mande a sila ki nan pati pi anndan nan kay la: “Èske gen lòt moun avèk ou?” Epi sila a va reponn: “Nanpwen moun”. Konsa li va reponn: “Rete an silans. Paske non a SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 44:26">Jr 44:26</ref></char></note>pa dwe nonmen menm.”<verse eid="AMO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 6:11"/>“Paske gade byen, SENYÈ a pral <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:11">És 55:11</ref> </char></note>kòmande</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:11">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:9">II Wa 25:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note> pou gwo lakay la vin kraze nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:11">e ti kay la an ti mòso.<verse eid="AMO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 6:12"/>Èske cheval konn kouri sou wòch,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:12">oswa èske yo ka charye wòch yo ak bèf?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:12">Konsa, nou te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:7-13">I Wa 21:7-13</ref></char></note>Lajistis vin tounen pwazon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:12">e fwi ladwati vin anmè nèt.<verse eid="AMO 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 6:13"/>Nou menm k ap rejwi nan yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 8:14">Job 8:14</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 8:15">15</ref></char></note>bagay ki pa anyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:13">epi k ap di: ‘Èske se pa ak pwòp fòs kouraj</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:13">nou nou rive pran kòn nan pou nou?’<verse eid="AMO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 6:14"/>Paske gade byen, Mwen pral leve yon nasyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:14">kont nou, O lakay Israël,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:14">deklare SENYÈ Bondye dèzame yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:14">“e yo va aflije nou soti nan antre Hamath</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 6:14">pou rive jis nan flèv Araba a.”<verse eid="AMO 6:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="AMO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 7:1"/>Konsa Senyè BONDYE a te montre m e gade byen, Li t ap fòme yon gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:4">Jl 1:4</ref> </char></note>rafal krikèt nan lè jaden prentan an te kòmanse boujonnen an. Epi gade byen, rekòlt la te fèt nan lè wa a te fin koupe zèb la. <verse eid="AMO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 7:2"/>Epi li te vin rive lè li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 10:15">Egz 10:15</ref></char></note>fin manje tout plant peyi a, ke m te di: “Senyè BONDYE, souple, padone! Kòman Jacob ka kanpe? Li tèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 37:4">És 37:4</ref> </char></note>piti!”<verse eid="AMO 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 7:3"/>SENYÈ a te repanti de sa. “Sa p ap rive,” SENYÈ a te di.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:36">Det 32:36</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 7:4"/>Konsa Senyè BONDYE a te montre mwen, e gade byen, Senyè BONDYE a t ap rele pou jijman an ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:22">Det 32:22</ref> </char></note>dife a. Li te devore tout gwo pwofondè a, e te kòmanse devore tèren nan. <verse eid="AMO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 7:5"/>Epi mwen te di: “Senyè, souple, sispann! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 7:2">Am 7:2</ref> </char></note>Kòman Jacob ka kanpe? Li tèlman piti!”<verse eid="AMO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 7:6"/>SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:45">Sòm 106:45</ref> </char></note>repanti de sa. “Sa a tou, p ap rive”, Senyè BONDYE a te di.<verse eid="AMO 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 7:7"/>Konsa Li te monte m, e gade byen, Senyè a te kanpe akote yon mi ki monte ak yon filaplon nan men L. <verse eid="AMO 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 7:8"/>SENYÈ a te di m: “Se kisa ou wè, Amos?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 7:8">Mwen te di: “Yon filaplon.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 7:8">Konsa, Senyè a te di: “Gade byen, Mwen prèt pou plase yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:13">II Wa 21:13</ref></char></note>filaplon nan mitan pèp Mwen an, Israël. Mwen p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:6">Jr 15:6</ref> </char></note>kite yo chape ankò. <verse eid="AMO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 7:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1">Jen 46:1</ref></char></note>Wo plas Isaac yo va vin abandone, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:31">Lev 26:31</ref> </char></note>sanktyè Israël yo va vin kraze nèt. Answit, Mwen va leve kont lakay Jéroboam ak nepe.”<verse eid="AMO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 7:10"/>Konsa, Amatsia, prèt Béthel la te voye pawòl kote Jéroboam, wa Israël la. Li te di: “Amos te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:8-11">Jr 26:8-11</ref> </char></note>fè konplo kont ou nan mitan kay Israël la. Peyi a p ap ka sipòte tout pawòl li yo. <verse eid="AMO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 7:11"/>Paske konsa Amos di: ‘Jéroboam va mouri pa nepe a, e Israël va anverite kite peyi li pou ale an egzil.’”<verse eid="AMO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 7:12"/>Amatsia te di a Amos: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:34">Mat 8:34</ref> </char></note>“Ale, ou menm ki divinò, sove ale nan peyi Juda. Manje pen e pwofetize la! <verse eid="AMO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 7:13"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:12">Am 2:12</ref></char></note>pa pwofetize nan Béthel, paske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:29">I Wa 12:29</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 12:32">32</ref> </char></note>sanktyè ak rezidans la a wa a!”<verse eid="AMO 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 7:14"/>Konsa, Amos te reponn a Amatsia: “Mwen pa t yon pwofèt, ni mwen pa t fis a yon pwofèt; men mwen te yon gadyen bèt ak yon kiltivatè pye fig frans.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:35">I Wa 20:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="AMO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 7:15"/>Men SENYÈ a te retire mwen soti dèyè bann mouton an, e SENYÈ a te di mwen: ‘Ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:7">Jr 1:7</ref> </char></note>pwofetize a pèp Mwen an, Israël.’ <verse eid="AMO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="AMO 7:16"/>Konsa, tande pawòl SENYÈ a: “W ap di: ‘Ou pa pou pwofetize kont Israël, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:2">Det 32:2</ref> </char></note>ni ou pa pou pale kont lakay Isaac.’ <verse eid="AMO 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="AMO 7:17"/>Akoz sa, SENYÈ a di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:13">Os 4:13</ref>,<ref loc="HOS 4:14">14</ref></char></note>‘Madanm ou va devni yon pwostitiye nan vil la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:16">Jr 14:16</ref> </char></note>fis ou yo ak fi ou yo va tonbe pa nepe, peyi ou a va divize ak yon lign apantaj, e ou menm, ou va mouri nan yon peyi ki pa pwòp. Anplis, Israël va anverite kite peyi li a pou li ale an egzil.’”<verse eid="AMO 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="AMO 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 8:1"/>Konsa Senyè BONDYE a te montre mwen, e gade byen, te gen yon panyen fwi gran sezon.<verse eid="AMO 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 8:2"/>Li te di: “Kisa ou wè, Amos?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 8:2">Epi mwen te di: “Yon panyen fwi gran sezon.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="AMO 8:2">Konsa, SENYÈ a te di mwen:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:2">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 7:2">Éz 7:2</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 7:3">3</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 7:6">6</ref></char>
    </note>“Lafen gen tan rive pou pèp Mwen an, Israël.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:2">Mwen p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 7:8">Am 7:8</ref> </char></note>pwoteje yo ankò.<verse eid="AMO 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 8:3"/>Kantik a tanp la va tounen chan lamantasyon</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:3">nan jou sa a,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:3">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 6:8-10">Am 6:8-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Kadav yo va anpil.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:3">Nan chak andwa, yo va jete yo deyò an silans.<verse eid="AMO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 8:4"/>Tande sa, nou menm k ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:4">Sòm 14:4</ref></char></note> vale malere yo nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:4">pou mete fen a tout pòv yo,<verse eid="AMO 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 8:5"/>ka p di: ‘Kilè nouvèl lin nan ap fini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:5">pou nou ka vann sereyal la?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:5">Ak Saba a pou nou ka ouvri mache ble a?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:5">N ap fè efa a pi piti, e sik la pi gwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:5">Anplis, n ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:7">Os 12:7</ref> </char></note>twonpe ak balans malonèt,<verse eid="AMO 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 8:6"/>pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:6">Am 2:6</ref></char></note>achte sila ki san sekou a pou lajan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:6">ak malere a pou de grenn sapat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:6">Menm balizaj ble a n ap vann!’”<verse eid="AMO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 8:7"/>SENYÈ a te sèmante pa glwa Jacob la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:7">“Anverite, Mwen p ap janm bliye okenn nan zak yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:11">Sòm 10:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="AMO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 8:8"/>Akoz sa, èske peyi a p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:7">Sòm 18:7</ref> </char></note>pran tranble,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:8">e tout moun ki rete ladann p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 4:3">Os 4:3</ref></char></note> fè lamantasyon?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:8">Anverite, tout peyi a va leve tankou Rivyè Nil la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:8">Li va vin ajite toupatou e bese tankou Rivyè Égypte la.<verse eid="AMO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 8:9"/>Li va vin rive nan jou sa a”, deklare Senyè BONDYE a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:9">ke Mwen va fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:14">Job 5:14</ref></char></note>solèy la desann a midi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:9">e mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:9">És 59:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 59:10">10</ref> </char></note>fè tè a nan fènwa nan plen jounen.<verse eid="AMO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 8:10"/>Answit, Mwen va fè fèt nou yo vin tounen dèy;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:10">tout chan lajwa nou yo va tounen lamantasyon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:10">Mwen va fè nou pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:2">És 15:2</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 15:3">3</ref> </char></note>twal sak sou senti a tout moun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:10">ak tèt chòv sou tout tèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:10">Mwen va fè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:26">Jr 6:26</ref></char></note>tankou yon moman dèy</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:10">pou yon sèl fis inik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:10">e lafen li tankou yon jou anmè.<verse eid="AMO 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 8:11"/>“Gade byen, jou yo ap vini,” deklare Senyè BONDYE a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:11">“lè Mwen va voye gwo grangou sou peyi a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:11">pa yon grangou pou pen oswa pou dlo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:11">men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:1">I Sam 3:1</ref></char></note>pou koute pawòl SENYÈ a.<verse eid="AMO 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 8:12"/>Pèp la va kilbite tou egare</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:12">sòti nan yon lanmè pou rive nan lòt lanmè,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:12">e sòti nan nò pou rive menm nan lès;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:12">yo va gaye toupatou pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 20:3">Éz 20:3</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 20:31">31</ref></char></note>chache pawòl SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:12">men yo p ap jwenn li.<verse eid="AMO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 8:13"/>Nan jou sa a, bèl tifi vyèj yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:13">ak jennonm yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:17">És 41:17</ref> </char></note>vin endispoze akoz swaf la.<verse eid="AMO 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 8:14"/>Menm jan pou sila ki sèmante pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:5">Os 8:5</ref> </char></note>peche Samarie a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:14">ki di: ‘Jan dye ou a vivan an, O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">I Wa 12:28</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 12:29">29</ref></char></note>Dan!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:14">e ‘Jan chemen Beer-Schéba vivan an’;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 8:14">yo va tonbe e yo p ap leve ankò.”<verse eid="AMO 8:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="AMO 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="AMO 9:1"/>Mwen te wè Senyè a, ki te kanpe akote lotèl la, e Li te di: “Frape tèt poto yo jiskaske papòt yo tranble. Kraze yo an moso sou tèt a yo tout! Answit, mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 7:17">Am 7:17</ref></char></note>touye rès yo ak nepe. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:11">Jr 11:11</ref> </char></note>p ap gen yon grenn refijye ki pou sove ale, ni yon refijye k ap chape. <verse eid="AMO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="AMO 9:2"/>Menmsi yo ta fouye antre nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:8">Sòm 139:8</ref></char></note>sejou mò yo; la, men, Mwen va pran yo soti la. Menmsi yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:53">Jr 51:53</ref> </char></note>monte rive nan syèl la, Mwen va rale yo soti la pou fè yo desann. <verse eid="AMO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="AMO 9:3"/>Menmsi yo kache sou tèt mòn Carmel la, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:16">Jr 16:16</ref></char></note>chèche fè yo soti la; epi menmsi yo ta kache kò yo anba nan pwofondè lanmè a, mwen va kòmande <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:1">És 27:1</ref> </char></note>sèpan an, e li va mòde yo. <verse eid="AMO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="AMO 9:4"/>Menmsi yo antre an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref> </char></note>kaptivite devan lènmi yo, Mwen va kòmande nepe soti la pou touye yo. Konsa, Mwen va fikse zye M kont yo pou mal, e non pa pou byen. <verse eid="AMO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="AMO 9:5"/>Senyè BONDYE dèzame yo, se Sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:32">Sòm 104:32</ref></char></note>touche tè a pou li fann, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 8:8">Am 8:8</ref> </char></note>tout sila ki rete ladann yo, va fè dèy. Kriye sa a va monte tankou Rivyè Nil lan, e vin bese ankò tankou Nil Égypte la. <verse eid="AMO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="AMO 9:6"/>Sila ki bati chanm wo Li yo nan syèl yo, e ki te etabli vout plafon syèl la anwo tè a, sila ki rele dlo lanmè yo pou vide yo sou sifas tè a—se SENYÈ a ki non Li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:3">Sòm 104:3</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 104:13">13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="AMO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="AMO 9:7"/>Èske nou pa tankou fis a Ethiopie yo pou Mwen, O fis Israël yo?” deklare SENYÈ a. “Èske Mwen pa t mennen Israël fè l monte soti nan peyi Égypte, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:23">Det 2:23</ref> </char></note>Filisten yo soti Caphtor e Siryen yo soti Kir? <verse eid="AMO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="AMO 9:8"/>Gade byen, zye a Senyè BONDYE a sou wayòm nan ki plen peche a; Mwen va detwi l soti sou sifas tè a. Sepandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:10">Jr 5:10</ref> </char></note>Lakay Jacob la p ap detwi nèt,” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="AMO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="AMO 9:9"/>“Paske gade byen, Mwen ap kòmande, e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:28">És 30:28</ref> </char></note>souke lakay Israël pami nasyon yo, tankou yon grenn k ap souke nan yon paswa, men menm yon grenn p ap tonbe atè. <verse eid="AMO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="AMO 9:10"/>Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 33:14">És 33:14</ref> </char></note>pechè pami pèp Mwen an va mouri pa nepe, sila yo k ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 6:3">Am 6:3</ref> </char></note>‘Malè pa rive sou nou ni parèt devan nou.’ <verse eid="AMO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="AMO 9:11"/>Nan jou sa a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:16-18">Trav 15:16-18</ref></char></note>fè leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 16:5">És 16:5</ref> </char></note>Lakay David ki te tonbe a, e ranfòse brèch li yo. Anplis, Mwen va leve mazi kraze li yo, e fè l vin rebati tankou nan jou ansyen yo; <verse eid="AMO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="AMO 9:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="OBA 1:19">Ab 19</ref></char></note>pou yo kapab vin posede retay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:18">Nonb 24:18</ref> </char></note>Édom an ak tout nasyon ki rele pa non Mwen yo,” deklare SENYÈ ki fè sa a.<verse eid="AMO 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="AMO 9:13"/>“Gade byen, jou yo ap vini,” deklare</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">“lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:5">Lev 26:5</ref> </char></note>sila k ap raboure a va depase sila</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">k ap rekòlte a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">e sila k ap foule rezen an va depase</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">sila k ap simen grenn nan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:18">Jl 3:18</ref></char></note>mòn yo va degoute diven dous e</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:13">tout kolin yo va vin fann nèt ak dousè li.<verse eid="AMO 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="AMO 9:14"/>Anplis, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 53:6">Sòm 53:6</ref> </char></note>restore pèp Mwen an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">Israël, ki an kaptivite a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">e yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:4">És 61:4</ref></char></note>rebati vil ki kraze nèt yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">pou yo viv ladan yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">Anplis, yo va plante chan rezen yo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">pou bwè diven yo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:14">epi fè jaden pou manje fwi yo.<verse eid="AMO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="AMO 9:15"/>Mwen va osi plante yo sou pwòp tèren pa yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:15">e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:21">És 60:21</ref></char></note>yo p ap dechouke yo ankò soti nan peyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:15">ke Mwen te bay yo a,” pale SENYÈ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="AMO 9:15">Bondye Ou a.<verse eid="AMO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="AMO 9"/>
</usx>
